### Feature Trainer — DELETE físico / DELETE lógico
### Leyenda: SIN AUTH (sin middleware JWT / sin autenticación)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@id = 1

# @name deleteTrainerPhysical
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/entrenadores/{{id}}

###

# @name deleteTrainerLogical
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/entrenadores/{{id}}/deactivate
